## Verification Plan

### Automated/Browser Testing
- Use the browser tool to:
    1. Navigate to [/profile.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/profile.html).
    2. Fill in the new and existing fields and save.
    3. Verify that changes persist after a page reload.
    4. Navigate to [/dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.html) and verify that the new info (Job Title, etc.) appears correctly in the sidebar and dropdown.
    5. Test password change functionality.

### Manual Verification
- Check the `users_v2.db` directly to ensure columns were added and data is stored correctly.
- Verify the layout remains clean and responsive on different screen sizes.
